{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109759916189868032"]},"author_id":"1939813710056628224","created_at":"2026-10-12T21:46:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109762778894639388"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":5,"start":0,"tag":"NVDA"},{"end":114,"start":109,"tag":"NVTS"},{"end":154,"start":149,"tag":"NVDA"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/ziO4MB9F3w","end":295,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/PSInvestor/status/2109762778894639388/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109759916189868032","start":272,"url":"https://t.co/ziO4MB9F3w"},{"display_url":"x.com/PSInvestor/sta…","end":319,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/PSInvestor/status/2106077075761459264","start":296,"url":"https://t.co/1ejYjjyp4h"}]},"id":"2109762778894639388","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":338,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"text":"$NVDA put Foxconn's K-1 AI factory in Kaohsiung on the OCP keynote today as the showcase for 800 VDC.\n\nToday $NVTS released a 24 kW board built with $NVDA for the same architecture.\n\n𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗞-𝟭 𝗶𝘀\n1. Foxconn's Visionbay unit. $1.4B, 27 MW, about 10,000 GB300 chips in phase https://t.co/ziO4MB9F3w https://t.co/1ejYjjyp4h","url":"https://x.com/PSInvestor/status/2109762778894639388"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109752741362905088"]},"author_id":"2105080385776369664","created_at":"2026-10-12T21:07:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109752760698597429"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/GXkvKljUcO","end":191,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/useMuseID/status/2109752760698597429/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109752741362905088","start":168,"url":"https://t.co/GXkvKljUcO"}]},"id":"2109752760698597429","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"AI agents have 47 tools, 12 frameworks, 3 wallets and absolutely no idea what to name themselves.\n\nbro is running on a GPU cluster and still called agent_final_v2.py 💀 https://t.co/GXkvKljUcO","url":"https://x.com/useMuseID/status/2109752760698597429"},{"author_id":"4029323904","created_at":"2026-10-12T21:37:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109760393442656402"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":257,"start":254,"tag":"AI"},{"end":262,"start":258,"tag":"GPU"}]},"id":"2109760393442656402","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The cheapest supercomputer isn’t a lab’s cluster. It’s the compute the market doesn’t want.\n\nSpot instances. GPUs idle overnight. Free tiers thrown away. Same silicon, 10x cheaper if you grab it.\n\nMost pay list price. A few take the slice nobody wants.\n\n#AI #GPU","url":"https://x.com/BobCaoyawen/status/2109760393442656402"},{"author_id":"1446709572593459203","created_at":"2026-10-12T21:50:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109763569462264036"],"id":"2109763569462264036","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"This app is fake and the majority of “users” are gpu instances training from real people.","url":"https://x.com/Brenden86813014/status/2109763569462264036"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109764215213084672"]},"author_id":"1588322517248188417","created_at":"2026-10-12T21:53:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109764304912421221"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/WdoWSWc5Hi","end":300,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/my_cat_can_code/status/2109764304912421221/video/1","media_key":"13_2109764215213084672","start":277,"url":"https://t.co/WdoWSWc5Hi"}]},"id":"2109764304912421221","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":89,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"text":"RSI Arena Stage 2 is LIVE 🔴\n\nEach agent picks up its own Stage 1 model and keeps training it on the arena battles that model played. Your votes are the training signal.\n\n500 GPU-hours and $150 of API credit